#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Today’s topic is about what teens see online. \n"
"\n"
"Teens see all kinds of things online. Some of it is interesting, some is confusing or upsetting, and some is not even real."
msgstr ""
"Isihloko sanamhlanje simalunga nento abantwana abafikisayo abayibonayo kwi intanethi. \n"
"\n"
"Abantwana abafikisayo babona zonke iintlobo zezinto kwi intanethi. Ezinye zazo zinika umdla, ezinye ziyabhidisa okanye ziyacaphukisa, kwaye ezinye aziyonyani."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Many teens come across sexual content, often without looking for it. They may feel curious, confused or uncomfortable. These feelings are normal. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Many parents feel unsure how to talk about this. That's normal too. What helps most is staying calm and talking together."
msgstr ""
"Abantwana abaninzi abafikisayo baye badibane nemixholo engesondo, rhoqo ngaphandle kokuyikhangela. Bangaziva benomdla, bebhidekile okanye bengakhululekanga. Ezi mvakalelo ziqhelekile. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Abazali abaninzi baziva bengaqinisekanga ukuba bangathetha njani malunga ngalento. Naleyo iqhelekile nayo. Eyona nto inceda kakhulu kukuhlala uzolile kwaye nithethe kunye."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.media_female_1.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Hear how talking openly helped @data.characters.media_female_1.name and her teen connect"
msgstr "Mamela ukuba ukuthetha ngokuvulekileyo kumncede njani u@data.characters.media_female_1.name ukuba anxulumane nomntwana wakhe ofikisayo"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "The other day, my son told me that a sexual video had popped up on his phone. I didn’t know what to say and I wanted to panic, but instead I listened first and we could talk. It was an uncomfortable conversation, but I'm glad we had it. Now he knows he can come to me if something online worries or confuses him."
msgstr "Kusuku oludlulileyo, unyana wam undixelela ukuba kuvele iVidiyo enomxholo wokwabelana ngesondo kwifowuni yakhe. Ndiye ndangazi ukuba mandithini, kwaye bendifuna nokothuka, kodwa endaweni yoko ndiye ndammamela kuqala saze saxoxa kamva. Ibiyincoko engakhululekanga, kodwa ndiyavuya sibenayo. Ngoku uyayazi ukuba angeza kum xa kukho into kwi-intanethi emxhalabisayo okanye embhidayo."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_daughter_16.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Let’s see how @data.characters.f1_daughter_16.name talks to her mother about something she saw online."
msgstr "Masibone indlela u @data.characters.f1_daughter_16.name athetha ngayo no mama wakhe ngento ayibone kwi-intanethi."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.friend_male_1.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Hey, look at this! People are saying it’s @data.characters.friend_male_1.name from our school."
msgstr "Hey, jonga lento! Abantu bathi ngu @data.characters.friend_male_1.name wase sikolweni sethu."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "No way… look at what he is doing."
msgstr "Hayi khona…jonga lento ayenzayo."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yeah… something doesn’t look right."
msgstr "Ewe…ikhona into engabonakali kakuhle."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "People can fake videos now… make it look like someone did something they didn’t do. They can even put someone’s face on a naked body."
msgstr "Abantu bangakwazi ukwenza iividiyo ezingeyonyani ngoku…benze ngathi umntu wenze into engayenzanga. Bangabeka nobuso balomntu kumzimba oze/umzimba onganxibanga."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Everyone is sharing it… Should I send it to our WhatsApp group?"
msgstr "Wonke umntu wabelane ngayo… Ndingayithumela kwi qonga lethu lika WhatsApp?"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yeah. I mean, everyone has seen it already anyway."
msgstr "Ewe. Ndixela ukuba, wonke umntu sele eyibonile kuyafana."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.friend_male_1.name. should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "What if it’s not even real? That could mess things up for @data.characters.friend_male_1.name."
msgstr "Ukuba kuthe kanti ayonyani? Lonto ingammoshela izinto u @data.characters.friend_male_1.name."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_daughter_16.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "@data.characters.f1_daughter_16.name comes home from school and talks to her mother."
msgstr "@data.characters.f1_daughter_16.name ubuya esikolweni kwaye uthetha ku mama wakhe."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Mother, how do you know if something online is real or not?\n"
"\n"
"And is it okay to share it?"
msgstr ""
"Mama, Wazi njani ukuba into ekwi intanethi yinyani okanye ayonyani?\n"
"\n"
"Kwaye ingaba kulungile ukwabelana ngayo?"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Good question. Many things online are not real, including videos and pictures. \n"
"\n"
"Sometimes, sharing things online can be harmful or even illegal."
msgstr ""
"Ngumbuzo omhle. Izinto ezininzi kwi intanethi aziyonyani, ukuquka ividiyo kunye nemifanekiso. \n"
"\n"
"Ngamanye amaxesha, ukwabelana ngezinto kwi intanethi kungabanobungozi okanye kube akukho mthethweni."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Before you believe something or share it, it helps to ask: who shared this and why? \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"And think, would sharing this hurt someone?"
msgstr ""
"Phambi kokuba ukholelwe entweni okanye wabelane ngayo, kuyanceda ukubuza: ngubani owabelene ngalento kwaye kutheni? \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Kwaye cinga, ingaba ukwabelana ngalento kungalimaza omnye umntu?"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Okay, that makes sense. Thank you, mother."
msgstr "Kulungile, kuyavakala. Enkosi kuwe, mama."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Let's think about what happened."
msgstr "Makhe sicinge ngalento yenzekileyo."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_daughter_13.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "What does mother do to help @data.characters.f1_daughter_13.name think about this?"
msgstr "Wenzani umama ukunceda u @data.characters.f1_daughter_13.name acinge malunga nalento?"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yes, staying calm helps your teen feel safe to talk."
msgstr "Ewe, ukuhlala uzolile kwenza umntwana wakho ofikisayo azive ekhuselekile ukuba angathetha nawe."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Ask simple questions"
msgstr "Buza imibuzo elula"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Exactly. Questions help your teen think about what they are seeing."
msgstr "Ngokwenene. Imibuzo inceda umntwana wakho ofikisayo acinge ngoko akubonayo."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Talk about not sharing too quickly"
msgstr "Thetha malunga nokungakhawulezi ngokwabelana"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yes, pausing before sharing can prevent harm."
msgstr "Ewe, ukuma phambi kokwabelana kungakwazi ukubalekela ukonzakala. ukonzakala."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Remind her she can always talk to her"
msgstr "Mkhumbuze ukuba angakwazi ukuthetha kunye nawe"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "That’s right. Being open helps our teens trust and share with us."
msgstr "Kulungile. Ukuvuleka kunceda ubantwana bethu basikuthembe kwaye babelane nathi."

#. type=data_list
#. The following strings should not be translated: 
#.      @data.characters.f1_mother.name
#.      @data.characters.f1_daughter_13.name.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"@data.characters.f1_mother.name did her best to guide @data.characters.f1_daughter_13.name.\n"
"\n"
"When you or your teen are not sure about something online, these questions help."
msgstr ""
"@data.characters.f1_mother.name wenze kangangoko ukumxhasa u @data.characters.f1_daughter_13.name.\n"
"\n"
"Xana wena okanye nomntwana wakho aniqinisekanga malunga nento ye intanethi, lemibuzo inganceda."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"🙍🏾 **Who made it?** Knowing who made it helps you decide if you can trust it.\n"
"❓ **Why was it shared?** Some content is made to get attention or to hurt someone.\n"
"⚠️ **Does it seem too good to be true?** If something feels strange, pause before you trust it or share it.\n"
"💙 **Is it okay to share?** Check with the person in the picture first. Sharing can spread something untrue or harmful."
msgstr ""
"🙍🏾**Ngubani oyenzileyo?** Ukwazi ukuba ngubani oyenzileyo inceda wena wenze isigqibo sokuba ungakwazi ukumthemba.\n"
"❓**Kutheni iye kwabelwana ngayo?** Ezinye izixhobo zenzelwe ukufumana ingqwalasela okanye ukulimaza omnye umntu.\n"
"⚠️**Iingaba ikhangeleka ilunge kakhulu ukuba ibeyinyani?** Ukuba kunento evakala ingaqhelekanga, yima phambi kokuba uyithembe lento okanye ukwabelana ngayo.\n"
"💙 **Ingaba kulungile ukwabelana ngayo?** Qonda kumntu lo usemfanekisweni kuqala. Ukwabelana kungasabalaza into engeyonyani okanye elimazayo."

#. type=data_list
#. The following strings should not be translated: 
#.      @data.characters.f1_father.name
#.      @data.characters.f1_son_14.name.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Not everything online is real, and that is also true for sexual content. \n"
"\n"
"Let's see how @data.characters.f1_father.name starts a conversation with his son, @data.characters.f1_son_14.name."
msgstr ""
"Hayi yonke into kwi intanethi iyinyani, kwaye lonto inyanisekile kumxholo wocantsi. \n"
"\n"
"Makhe sijonge weenza njani u@data.characters.f1_father.name ukuqalisa le ncoko kunye nonyana wakhe, @data.characters.f1_son_14.name."

#. type=data_list
#. The following strings should not be translated: 
#.      @data.characters.f1_father.name
#.      @data.characters.f1_son_14.name
#.      @data.characters.f1_son_14.name
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "@data.characters.f1_father.name and @data.characters.f1_son_14.name are making a fire for a braai. @data.characters.f1_son_14.name looks at his phone to put on some music."
msgstr "U @data.characters.f1_father.name no @data.characters.f1_son_14.name babasa umlilo wokosa inyama. U @data.characters.f1_son_14.name ujonge ifowuni yakhe uvula umculo."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_son_14.name, should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "@data.characters.f1_son_14.name, you know how sometimes things just pop up on your phone?"
msgstr "@data.characters.f1_son_14.name, uyazi ukuba ngamanye amaxesha izinto zivele zivumbuluke nje kwi fowuni yakho?"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "Uthetha ukuthini?"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "For example, you can be scrolling, and suddenly there's a video of people without clothes...and you weren't even looking for that! Has that ever happened to you?"
msgstr "Umzekelo, Ungabe uyazikhangelela nje, kuthi gqi ngequbuliso ividiyo yabantu abanganxibanga mpahla...kwaye ubungakhangeli kwalonto! Ingaba yakhe yenze lonto kuwe?"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "I guess I've seen that."
msgstr "Ndicinga ndakhe ndayibona lonto."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"That happens to a lot of young people. It may feel strange, or interesting, or confusing. \n"
"\n"
"Just know, you did nothing wrong by seeing something that pops up."
msgstr ""
"Lonto yenzeka kakhulu kubantu abatsha. Ingakhangeleka ingaqhelekanga, okanye inikisa umdla, okanye ibhidisa. \n"
"\n"
"Yazi nje, awenzanga nto imbi nakanye ngokubona into esuke yazivelela."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Porn is made to get attention. It does not show how people should treat each other in real life. \n"
"\n"
"It can give you the wrong ideas about sex and relationships."
msgstr ""
"Iporn yenzelwe ukufumana ingqwalasela. Ayibonisi ukuba kumele abantu baziphathe njani kubomi bamanyani. \n"
"\n"
"Ingakunika iimibono engalunganga malunga nocantsi kunye nobudlelwane."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"If you ever see something that makes you uncomfortable, come to me. I will listen and I won't get angry. \n"
"\n"
"If talking to me about it feels weird, talk to another adult you trust."
msgstr ""
"Ukuba wakhe wabona into eyakwenza uzive ungakhululekanga, yiza kum. Ndizomamela kwaye andizobanamsindo. \n"
"\n"
"Ukuba ukuthetha ngayo kukwenza uzive umangalisekile, thetha nomnye umntu omdala ongamthemba."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Okay, father."
msgstr "Kulungile, tata."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Let's think about that conversation."
msgstr "Makhe sicinge malunga nale ncoko."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_son_14.name? should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Why is it important for father to have this conversation with @data.characters.f1_son_14.name?"
msgstr "Kutheni kubalulekile ukuba utata abenalencoko no @data.characters.f1_son_14.name?"

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_son_14.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "@data.characters.f1_son_14.name may feel confused or unsure"
msgstr "U @data.characters.f1_son_14.name angaziva ebhidekile okanye engaqinisekanga"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yes. Teens can feel curious, uncomfortable or confused after seeing sexual content."
msgstr "Ewe. Abantwana bangaziva benomdla, bengakhululekanga oaknye bebhidekile emva bebone umxholo wocantsi."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_son_14.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "@data.characters.f1_son_14.name may get unrealistic ideas about relationships"
msgstr "U@data.characters.f1_son_14.name angafumana iimbono ezingeyonyani malunga nobudlelwane"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Correct. What is shown is often not real and can give confusing ideas about relationships."
msgstr "Ngokwenyani. Lento ibonisiweyo idla ngokungabiyo nyani kwaye ingadala ingcinga ezibhidisayo malunga nobudlelwane."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_son_14.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "@data.characters.f1_son_14.name needs to know he can talk"
msgstr "U @data.characters.f1_son_14.name kufuneka azi ukuba angakwazi ukuthetha"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "That’s right. When teens feel safe to talk, they are more likely to ask for help."
msgstr "Kunjalo. Xa abantwana abafikisayo beziva bekhuselekile ukuba bangathetha, badlangokuba lula ukucela uncedo."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_son_14.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Ignoring it may create problems for @data.characters.f1_son_14.name"
msgstr "Ukungayihoyi kungadala ingxaki ku @data.characters.f1_son_14.name"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Exactly. Most teens will see this content eventually. Without guidance, teens will try to figure things out on their own."
msgstr "Ngokwenene. Abantwana abaninzi abafikisayo bangawubona lomxholo nakanjani. Ngaphandle kokukhokelwa, abantwana abafikisayo bangazama ukufumanela izinto ngokunokwabo."

#. type=data_list
#. The following strings should not be translated: 
#.      @data.characters.f1_son_14.name
#.      @data.characters.f1_son_14.name
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "What rules could father and @data.characters.f1_son_14.name make so it is less likely that @data.characters.f1_son_14.name sees sexual content?"
msgstr "Ngeyiphi imithetho utata kunye no @data.characters.f1_son_14.name abangayenza kube kancinci ku @data.characters.f1_son_14.name ukuba abone umxholo wocantsi?"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Keep phones in shared spaces"
msgstr "Ngcina iifowuni kwiindawo ekwabelwana ngazo"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Charge phones outside the bedroom"
msgstr "Tshaja ifoni ngaphandle kwigumbi lokulala"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Talk about what to do if something happens"
msgstr "Thetha malunga nento onokuyenza ukuba kukho eyenzekayo"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Yes. Simple, agreed rules can help teens see less of this and feel safer to ask for help.\n"
"\n"
"Father can also explore how to add parental controls and content filters."
msgstr ""
"Ewe. Ngokulula, imithetho ekuvunyelwene ngayo inganceda abantwana abafikisayo bayibone kancinci le nto kwaye bazive bekhuselekile ukucela uncedo.\n"
"\n"
"Utata naye angakwazi ukuphonononga ukuba angayifaka njani ulwawulo lwabazali kunye nee filters zomxholo."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Check in regularly"
msgstr "Jonga rhoqo"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Yes, checking in regularly can help your teen know that you are there to support.\n"
"\n"
"Father can also explore how to add parental controls and content filters."
msgstr ""
"Ewe, ukujonga rhoqo kungakwazi ukunceda umntwana wakho ofikisayo ukuba ayazi ukhona ukumxhasa.\n"
"\n"
"Utata naye angakwazi ukuphononga ukuba angafaka njani u lawulo lwabazali kunye ne filters zomxholo."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_son_14.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"It was good to see @data.characters.f1_son_14.name talk openly with his father.\n"
"\n"
"One day your teen may come to you with something they have seen. How you respond teaches your teen whether it is safe to come to you again."
msgstr ""
"Bekulungile ukubona u @data.characters.f1_son_14.name ethetha ngokuphandle kunye notata wakhe.\n"
"\n"
"Ngenye imini umntwana wakho ofikisayo angeza kuwe nento ayibonileyo. Indlela ophendula ngayo ifundisa umntwana wakho ofikisayo wokuba kukhuselekile ukuza kuwe kwakhona."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Stay calm and take a breath"
msgstr "Hlala uzolile kwaye uphefumle"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Before you answer, take a breath."
msgstr "Phambi kokuba uphendule, phefumla."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Ask and listen"
msgstr "Buza kwaye mamela"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Try asking simple, open questions such as:\n"
"\n"
"- “Can you tell me what happened?”\n"
"- “How did it make you feel?”\n"
"- “What do you think about what you saw?”\n"
"\n"
"Listen without judging or rushing to solve the problem."
msgstr ""
"Zama ukubuza imibuzo elula, evulekileyo enjengale:\n"
"\n"
"-\"Ungakwazi ukundixelela okwenzekileyo?\"\n"
"-\"Ikwenze waziva njani wena?\"\n"
"-\"Ucinga ntoni malunga nento oyibonileyo?\"\n"
"\n"
"Mamela ngaphandle kokohlulela okanye ukungxamela ukusombulula ingxaki."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Reassure and support your teen"
msgstr "Qinisekisa kwaye uxhase umntwana wakho ofikisayo"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"You could say:\n"
"\n"
"- “Thank you for telling me.”\n"
"- “You did not do anything wrong.”\n"
"- “We can work through this together.”\n"
"\n"
"This helps reduce shame and makes it more likely your teen will come to you again."
msgstr ""
"Ungakwazi nokuthi:\n"
"\n"
"-\"Enkosi ngokundixelela.\"\n"
"-\"Awenzanga nanye into engalunganga.\"\n"
"-\"Singakwazi ukusebenzisana kulento kunye.\"\n"
"\n"
"Lento inceda ukwehlisa ihlazo kwaye yenza kuqheleke ukuba umntwana wakho ofikisayo eze kuwe kwakhona."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "End with connection"
msgstr "Gqibezela ngonxibelelwano"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Let your teen know they can always come to you if something online worries or confuses them."
msgstr "Vumela umntwana wakho ofikisayo ayazi ukuba angaza kuwe ukuba into kwi intanethi iyamkhathaza okanye iyambhida."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Here are some simple ways you can support your teen when they see or share things online that are confusing or sensitive."
msgstr "Nazi ezinye iindlela ezilula ongakwazi ukuxhasa umntwawna wakho ofikisayo xana ebona okanye esabelana ngezinto ezimbhidayo okanye ezibucayi."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "PREVENT"
msgstr "THINTELA"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"You cannot protect your teen from everything online, but simple routines and guidance can help.\n"
"\n"
"For example, leave devices, including phones, in shared family spaces."
msgstr ""
"Awukwazi ukukhusela umntwana wakho kwinto yonke yamakhasi onxibelelwano, kodwa inkqubo ezilula kunye nokukhokela kunganceda.\n"
"\n"
"Umzekelo, shiya izixhobo ukuquka iifoni, ukwabelana ngamathuba oosapho."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @global.library should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"You can agree on family rules together. \n"
"\n"
"Set a good example by following the same rules yourself.\n"
"\n"
"Connect with other parents to agree on similar rules - it’s easier for teens to accept rules that their friends’ families also follow.\n"
"\n"
"Using content filters also helps manage what your teen sees. Tap “Online safety” in the @global.library for tips on how to do that"
msgstr ""
"Ningakwazi ukuvumelana ngemithetho yosapho kunye. \n"
"\n"
"Yiba ngumzekelo olungileyo ngokulandela lemithetho ifanayo nawe.\n"
"\n"
"Nxibelelana kunye nabanye abazali ukuvumelana ngalemithetho efanayo - Kulula kubantwana abafikisayo ukwamkela imithetho\n"
"\n"
"Ukusebenzisa iifilters zomxholo kuye kuncede ukulawula into umntwana wakho ofikisayo ayibonayo. Cofa \" Ukhuseleko Kwi intanethi\" kwi @global.library zeengcebiso zokuba ungayenza njani lonto"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "THINK BEFORE YOU SHARE"
msgstr "CINGA PHAMBI KOKUBA WABELANE"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Help your teen pause before sharing things online. Ask: Could this hurt someone? Is it real? Then practise together what they can say: 'I don't send things like that.'\n"
"\n"
"Did you know that photos you share of your children online -- even innocent family moments -- can be used to create fake or sexual images? Think before you post, keep accounts private, and ask your teen before sharing photos of them."
msgstr ""
"Nceda umntwana wakho athi nqumama phambi kokwabelana ngezinto kwi intanethi. Buza: Ingamlimaza omnye umntu? Ngoko zamani kunye into abanokuyitsho: \"Andizithumeli izinto ezinjalo.\"\n"
"\n"
"Ingaba uyayazi na ukuba imifanekiso yabantwana bakho owabelana ngayo kwi intanethi - nanjengemizuzu emsulwa yosapho - ingasetyenziswa ukwakha imifanekiso engeyonyani okanye eyocantsi? Cinga phambi kokuba uposte, gcina i akhawunti ifihlakele, kwaye buza umntwana wakho ofikisayo phambi kokwabelane ngemifanekiso yabo."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Make sure your teen knows not to share personal information online. \n"
"\n"
"Remind them that sharing sexual, upsetting or harmful content is hurtful, and can get them in trouble too."
msgstr ""
"Qinisekisa ukuba umntwana wakho ofikisayo uyayazi ukuba akazikhuphi iinkcukacha zakhe kwi intanethi. \n"
"\n"
"Mkhumbuze ukuba ukwabelana ngemixholo yocantsi, ekhathazayo okanye enobungozi, kulimaza kakhulu, kwaye kungamfaka engxakini."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "STAY CALM"
msgstr "HLALA UZOLILE"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"If your teen tells you they saw something upsetting or sexual, stay calm and listen. \n"
"\n"
"Your reaction will teach them whether they feel safe to talk to you about these things."
msgstr ""
"Ukuba umntwana wakho ofikisayo ukuxelele ukuba ubone into ecaphukisayo okanye eyocantsi, hlala uzolile kwaye umamele. \n"
"\n"
"Imbonakalo yakho izakumfundisa ukuba ingaba ukhuselekile ukuba angathetha kunye nawe malunga nezizinto."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "More tips"
msgstr "Ezinye iingcebiso"

#. type=data_list
#. The string @global.library. should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Reassure your teen that they did nothing wrong. Avoid blame or anger so they feel safe coming to you again.\n"
"\n"
"For more tips on how to report harful content, go to “Online safety” in the @global.library."
msgstr ""
"Qinisekise umntwana wakho ofikisayo ukuba akenzanga nto engalunganga. Balekela ukukutyhola okanye umsindo ukwenzela azive ekhuselekile ukuza kuwe kwakhona.\n"
"\n"
"Ngengcebiso ezithe vetshe malunga nokuyochaza umxholo olimazayo, iya kwi \"Ukhuseleko kwi intanethi\" kwi @global.library."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "TALK RESPECT"
msgstr "THETHA NGENTLONIPHO"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Teens often learn what relationships look like from what they see online. \n"
"\n"
"Help your teen understand that relationships should feel safe, respectful and comfortable for everyone."
msgstr ""
"Abantwana abafikisayo bafunda ukuba bukhangeleka njani ubudlwelana kwinto abayibone kwi intanethi. \n"
"\n"
"Nceda umntwana wakho ofikisayo aqonde ukuba ubudlwelana kumele uzive ukhuselekile, uhloniphekile kwaye bakhululekile kumntu wonke."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Let’s practise how you could respond when your teen sees something online."
msgstr "Makhe sizame ungaphendula njani xana umntwana wakho ofikisayo ebone into kwi intanethi."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Scenario 1: Your teen shows you a video and says: “Everyone is sharing this. Do you think it is real?”"
msgstr "Umdlalo 1: Umntwana wakho ofikisayo ukubonisa ividiyo kwaye uthi: \"Wonke umntu wabelana ngalento. Ingaba ucinga ukuba iyinyani?\""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Stay calm and ask questions"
msgstr "Hlala uzolile kwaye ubuze imibuzo"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Get angry and tell them not to watch things like that"
msgstr "Yiba nomsindo kwaye umxelele ukuba angabukeli izinto ezinjalo"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Say you are not sure and think together"
msgstr "Yitsho ukuba awuqinisekanga kwaye nicinge kunye"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yes. Staying calm and discussing together helps your teen think and make safer choices."
msgstr "Ewe. Ukuhlala uzolile nincokole kunye kunceda umntwana wakho ofikisayo acinge kwaye enze izigqibo ezikhuselekileyo."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Not quite. Angry reactions or avoiding the conversation can stop your teen from sharing. Staying calm helps them feel safe to talk."
msgstr "Akunjalo. Ukuphendula ngomsindo okanye ukubalekela incoko kungenza umntwana wakho ofikisayo ayeke ukwabelana nawe. Ukuhlala uzolile kunceda ukuba bazive bekhuselekile ukuba bangathetha."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Let's continue practising. How could you respond to this scenario?"
msgstr "Masiqhubeke sizama. Ungaphendula njani kulomdlalo?"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Scenario 2: Your teen accidentally saw porn on their phone."
msgstr "Umdlalo 2: Umntwana wakho ofikisayo ngephanyazo ubone iphoni kwi foni yakho."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Get angry and blame them"
msgstr "Yiba nomsindo kwaye utyhole yena"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Reassure it’s not their fault"
msgstr "Mqinisekise ukuba akulotyala lakhe"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Ignore it"
msgstr "Sukuyihoya"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "That may not work. Strong reactions or ignoring it can make your teen feel ashamed and stop them from sharing."
msgstr "Isenokungasebenzi lonto. Ukuphendula ngamandla okanye ukungahoyi ingenza umntwana wakho ofikisayo azive enentloni kwaye ayeke ukwabelana."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Stay calm and listen"
msgstr "Hlala uzolile kwaye umamele"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yes. Staying calm and reassuring your teen helps them feel safe to talk and reduces shame."
msgstr "Ewe. Ukuhlala uzolile nokumqinisekisa umntwana wakho ofikisayo kumnceda ngokuba azive ekhuselekile ukuthetha nawe kwaye kwehlise intloni."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Ask how they felt about what they saw"
msgstr "Mbuze ukuba uziva njani malunga nakubonileyo"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yes. Ask them how they felt about what they saw. Were they upset or maybe curious? Their answer tells you what kind of support they need."
msgstr "Ewe. Mbuze ukuba uziva njani malunga nento ayibonileyo. Ingaba ebecaphukile okanye ebenomdla? Iimpendulo zakho zizo ezizakuxelela ukuba yinkxaso enjani azakuidinga."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "This week's home activity: talk with your teen about something they saw online. Ask them what felt interesting, confusing, or strange."
msgstr "Umsebenzi wasekhaya kule veki: thetha kunye nomntwana wakho malunga nento ayibone kwi intanethi. Mbuze yintoni evakala inomdla, ibhidisa okanye ingaqhelekanga."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"**Remember to ask:** \n"
"\n"
"What do you think about it? Do you think it is real? Why do you think it was shared? How can this affect others? \n"
"\n"
"Listen without judging and thank your teen for sharing."
msgstr ""
"**Khumbula ukubuza:** \n"
"\n"
"Ucinga ntoni malunga nayo? Ucinga ukuba yinyani? Ucinga ukuba kutheni kwabelwane ngayo? Ingabachaphazela njani abanye abantu lento? \n"
"\n"
"Mamela ngaphandle kokugweba kwaye umbulele umntwana wakho ofikisayo ngokwazi ukwabelana nawe."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Can you talk with your teen about something they have seen online this week?"
msgstr "Ungathetha nomntwana wakho ofikisayo ngento ayibone kwi-intanethi kuleveki?"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Ewe"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "That’s great! By staying calm and talking together, you help your teen feel safe to share and make better choices online."
msgstr "Yantle lonto! Ngokuhlala uzolile kwaye nithetha kunye, unceda umntwana wakho ofikisayo azive ekhuselekile ukwabelana kwaye enze izigqibo ezingcono kwi intanethi."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "I think so"
msgstr "Ndicinga njalo"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "You can do it! Try asking your teen about something they have seen online. A simple “What have you been watching lately?” is a great way to start."
msgstr "Ungayenza lento! Zama ukubuza umntwana wakho ofikisayo malunga nento ayibone kwi intanethi. Ngokulula \"Yintoni oyibukelayo mva nje?\" yindlela entel yokuqala."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Hayi"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "That’s okay. This kind of conversation can feel hard at first. Remember, staying calm and showing interest helps your teen feel safe to talk."
msgstr "Ilungile lonto. Lena inje incoko ingavakala inzima ekuqaleni. Khumbula, ukuhlala uzolile kwaye ukubonisa umdla kunceda umntwana wakho ofikisayo azive ekhuselekile ukuthetha."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Well done for taking time for yourself today. 🎉 \n"
"\n"
"If you need more support, you can find additional resources and support services in the Parent Library under \"Online Safety\"."
msgstr ""
"Wenze kakuhle ngokuthatha ixesha elilelakho namhlanje.🎉 \n"
"\n"
"Ukuba udinga inkxaso eninzi, ungakwazi ukufumana izixhobo ezongezelelweyo kunye neenkonzo zenkxaso kwi Thala lomzali phantsi kwe 'Ukhuseleko kwi Intanethi\"."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Here is a short video to help you slow down before you go"
msgstr "Nali ushicilelo olufutshane elizokunceda wehlise ngaphambi kokuba uhambe"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"When everything feels like it is falling apart And you can't help but raise your voice When all the frustrations are beginning to start Remember that you have a choice\n"
"\n"
"Let's slow down Take a few deep breaths Remember all we have to be grateful for Let's slow down Take a few deep breaths Because I really couldn't love you more\n"
"\n"
"You can take pause, you can count to 10 Play a game or do something fun You can phone a friend, someone to confide in Remember you're not the only one\n"
"\n"
"Let's slow down Take a few deep breaths Remember all we have to be grateful for Let's slow down Take a few deep breaths Because I really couldn't love you more\n"
"\n"
"Let's slow down Take a few deep breaths Remember all we have to be grateful for Let's slow down Take a few deep breaths Because I really couldn't love you more Because I really couldn't love you more"
msgstr ""
"Xa yonke into ivakala ingathi iyamoshakala Kwaye awukwazi ukuzinceda uvele unyuse ilizwi Xa zonke iinzingo ziqala Khumbula ukuba ungenza ngakumbi\n"
"\n"
"Makhe sime kancinci Tsala umoya kancinci Khumbula konke esino kubulela ngako Makhe sehlise kancinci Tsala umoya kancinci Kuba andinakuthanda ngakumbi\n"
"\n"
"Yima, ungabala uyokutsho ku 10 Dlala umdlalo okanye wenze into emnandi Ungafowunela umhlobo, umntu onokumchazela ingxaki Khumbula ayinguwe wedwa\n"
"\n"
"Makhe sime kancinci Tsala umoya kancinci Khumbula konke esino kubulela ngako Makhe sime Tsala umoya kancinci Kuba bendingenokuthanda ngakumbi \n"
"\n"
"Makhe sime kancinci Tsalaa umoya Khumbula konke esino kubulela ngako Makhe sime Tsalaa umoya kancinci Kuba bendingenokuthanda ngakumbi Kuba bendingenokuthanda ngakumbi"

